{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07543","headline":"咏史十一首 五 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦灭汉帝兴，南山有遗老。\n危冠揖万乘，幸得厌征讨。\n当君逐鹿时，臣等已枯槁。\n宁知市朝变，但觉林泉好。\n高卧三十年，相看成四皓。\n帝言翁甚善，见顾何不早。\n咸称太子仁，重义亦尊道。\n侧闻骊姬事，申生不自保。\n暂出商山云，朅来趋洒扫。\n东宫成羽翼，楚舞伤怀抱。\n後代无其人，戾园满秋草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}